<title>UK: London palladium fixes at fresh three-year low.</title>
<headline>London palladium fixes at fresh three-year low.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palladium fixed at $115.75 an ounce on Thursday afternoon, a fresh three-year low and equal to the fixing on September 14, 1993.</p>
<p>Dealers said palladium, which was fixed at $116.25 in the morning, was vulnerable to further losses. Some support was expected to emerge at $115 and then at $112 an ounce. --London newsroom +44 17 1542 2936</p>
</text>
